  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NeonOASIS v2.0.3\n\nNeon OASIS Provider — serverless PostgreSQL for OASIS holons and avatars via Npgsql ADO.NET. Pre-configures connection pooling and SSL for Neon's serverless endpoint format. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Apply verified Neon TLS policy to explicit ports and host lists (a01136f)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- refactor: reuse PostgreSQL storage family for Neon (2fcfc0f)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.NeonOASIS",
